{"server":"tw","storyId":"act29side_level_act29side_05_beg","groupId":"act29side","stageId":"act29side_05","title":"奏鳴曲“秋日”","storyCode":"ZT-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act29side/level_act29side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"fb7bdd6d6cba7525f52e2651a17cd98b980af232b72456526ecbaf8b17597fb0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"憲兵與學生都陷入幻覺，互相攻擊。看似友善的學者才是巫王殘黨，萊辛殺進密室保護黑鍵。費德里科找到阿爾圖羅，卻發現混亂並非她誘發，她的目標是金律法衛。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"僵持。\n這本來是一場突然發動的襲擊。海登施威爾大區的術師假扮樂手混入巫王塔，來自厄登赫爾和施彤領的軍隊則透過術式隱藏於塔外。\n沒人敢低估巫王的強大，但戰鬥還是比想像中的艱難。\n塔外的軍隊被恩瓦德的禁軍發現，第一批術師全部死在了塔基，第二批則被無盡的台階吞噬。\n殺至王座面前的只有那一對雙子。赫琳瑪特，還有她的姐妹伊維格娜德。\n黑色與紅色向來是烏提卡家族的顏色。可彼時的巫王塔，從塔前到塔內，都幾乎找不到一塊黑色的磚石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g3_ludwigsuniv_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏提卡的密室在地下，和奏鳴塔距離非常近。我們可以從奏鳴塔下去。弗萊蒙特閣下先行一步，我們也得儘快跟上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別再前進了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王的禁軍都到了，你們會死在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禁軍？您在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海登施威爾的人從沒想過你們能贏。他們只想讓施彤領的軍隊牽制禁軍，好讓那一對雙子順利地登塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在他們的計劃裡，巫王會死，雙子會死，你們也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴你父親還有恩斯特，霍赫貝格家族不該在這座塔裡葬送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特閣下，我的父親不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是我讓你變成了唯一活下來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我害你……失去了自由……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請您看著我，我是薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您把我當成了……我的父親嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在就走，離開路德維格大學。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特的密使傳達了女皇的命令。作為女皇之聲，你完全有理由中止任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了避免女皇之間的聲音不同步，伊維格娜德也不會懲罰你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您聽到周圍的聲響了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似曾相識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡幾乎淪為戰場。我職責在身，沒辦法護送你逃出去，但用旋律在混亂中闢出一條路還是做得到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忘不了，當我們踏入這片校園時，它還是那麼地寧靜純粹。那些年輕學生的臉上，洋溢著對未來的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不該淪為紛爭的犧牲品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我遠不及您和弗萊蒙特閣下強大，但我想盡可能地幫助更弱小的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面藏著赫爾昏佐倫的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊維格娜德說了，等女皇慶典結束後，你還有再選一次的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可一旦窺見萊塔尼亞最隱秘的部分，你將失去其他選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對此，早有預料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明渴望著自由，卻做不到在別人的痛苦面前，轉身離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很矛盾，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你和你的父親，很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我理解他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直……都理解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g5_spiralstairs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼，底下為什麼這麼多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們衝進來了！不光是奏鳴塔，邊上的學士塔也是，全都是學生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通通攔住！別讓他們堵住樓梯，我們沒辦法追人了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰動的手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，太亂了，我什麼都看不清！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1134_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫、巫王殘黨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聆聽吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聆聽這極致的混亂，以及混亂中唯一的旋律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是赫爾昏佐倫的輕嘆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們的王，留在這片大地上的，最後的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至高的塔，在地面上投下令人戰栗的陰影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不願被黑暗淹沒的人們劃動雙臂，攀住了向上的階梯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漆黑的意志盤桓於王座之上，靜待其他靈魂的垂詢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在帷幔後面的人，遺憾著愛情的隕落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"替代別人衝鋒的人，思索著英雄的定義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蹚過戰友血海的人，悲嘆著犧牲的代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們齊聚在螺旋階梯的盡頭，見證這首旋律的誕生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的名字叫作——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——《巫王之死》。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g5_spiralstairs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是巫王的軍隊，他們在向我衝過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"踏著天災而來的術師！刺穿整座城市的源石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救命啊，我不想死……不，死了也可以，請把我燒成飛灰吧，我不想被捏成一團活著的血肉……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼燒自己啊，笨蛋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這些人都瘋了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這聲音……管、管風琴！是巫王殘黨在演奏嗎？我們都被法術帶來的幻覺影……影響……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰站在台階上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是血，這麼多人……死了？站在血泊中的是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特……伊維格娜德！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，是你們！邪惡的雙子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳言都是真的，對不對？薩卡茲的法術塑造了你們的靈魂，叛徒的野心澆灌出你們的血肉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們殺死了萊塔尼亞的王，又佔據了萊塔尼亞的王座——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們生來就是要毀去萊塔尼亞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這樣的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特雖然很兇狠，但並不邪惡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是誰？你是女皇之聲嗎？你是踐行雙子意志的傀儡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她不讓我當女皇之聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我的性命是赫琳瑪特留下的。我想幫她，我想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得到魔鬼賞賜的人，也會變成魔鬼。看看這一切，你們把萊塔尼亞糟踐成了什麼樣子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座高塔……這所學校……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們留著路德維格大學，不就是為了假扮成萊塔尼亞人，裝作你們還有尊重傳統的體面嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我受夠了，受夠了課堂裡出現的女皇之聲，受夠了那些除了諂媚外一無是處的沙龍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的歷史、知識、藝術，都早就被殺死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如一起死吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1130_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺……殺了你們……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼源石技藝，為什麼我擋不住……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這是拳頭？我……"},{"type":"narration","text":"米夏埃爾茫然地睜大了眼睛。\n越來越多的人湧向奏鳴塔，在樂聲中混戰成一團。他們大多數都放下了法杖，選擇用拳頭，用腿腳，用牙齒。\n這還是他熟悉的萊塔尼亞嗎？\n他學過的言語技巧，戰鬥策略，甚至源石技藝本身都失去了效果。\n除了蜷縮在盾下，他什麼都做不了，就像變回了那個剛剛背井離鄉，來到崔林特爾梅的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放過我，求您……伊維格娜德，我什麼都願意做……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要……不要傷害我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特……赫琳瑪特……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請站起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舉起盾牌，朝向左邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人，幫我扶一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"憲兵？他是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道他的名字。但他是洛里斯·博爾丁的屬下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他剛才想用源石技藝轟炸我的頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還救他？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三座雕塑，擊碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是在執行任務，我沒有傷害他的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人有可能受到了源石技藝的影響，被內心深處最強烈的情緒支配，喪失了應有的理性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和他們纏鬥缺乏效率，建議你和我一樣，用最快的方式擊暈他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你就這樣，靠一路把人敲暈，在這混亂的人堆裡穿來穿去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我盡量把他們堆放在了不會被踩到或打到的角落裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，沒有一上來就揍我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"米夏·沃爾，你雖然年紀很小，但精神比一般成年人更強韌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我判斷，只要有人提示，你就能自己從幻覺中清醒過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其他人就未必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我並未接收到確切消息，但如果混亂真的由阿爾圖羅的琴聲引起，那除非她停止演奏，否則這些人的異常表現只會持續下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡交給你了，米夏·沃爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……叫我米夏埃爾吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"米夏埃爾，我必須繼續往上走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雕塑發出的奇怪聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些聲音聽起來很熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雕塑發出的奇怪聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"外面的階梯上，是不是和二十三年前一樣混亂不堪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慌張、焦急、恐懼、憤怒……所有的情感都因那座並不存在於此處的塔引起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屹立在萊塔尼亞中央的始源之塔啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當它再度發出聲響時，究竟能帶來什麼樣的樂章？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g7_ludwigsuniv_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫，唯一的王！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的瑰瑋支撐著高塔，你的榮光籠罩著大地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的靈魂恆久閃耀，你的法術永不消散！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞的智慧與優雅集於你身！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的輝煌與偉大成就了萊塔尼亞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抬起頭吧，匍匐於大地的血肉之軀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瞻仰王的尊榮與偉業！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於……我等到了這一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十多年來，我一直幻想著走過長長的階梯，來到這張王座面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好在命運讓我得到了您留在金律樂章上的術式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，您遺留的最後的旋律即將奏響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫，萊塔尼亞至高的王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請容許我再一次謁見您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請容許我……祈求您的原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗朗茨，好孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，我不得不打了你。頭還痛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為，你會有很多問題想問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，就是這個眼神。痛苦，但從來不願意屈服，就算跪倒在淤泥裡，也要蔑視比你強大的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強大？我所見的，只有一群瘋子在演戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的囈語，還不及我腦子裡的噪音值得聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我們精神錯亂了，把你當成巫王，虔誠懺悔，頂禮膜拜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜。我也希望，你真的能夠成為巫王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是……最初的實驗能成功就好了。我也希望我們一開始就能找到“塵世之音”的演奏方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的話，你，還有其他孩子，都不必受那麼大苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我竟然還把你當作……想要保護……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……哈哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的嘴角流血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的血最好真的有什麼邪惡力量，能灼穿你這虛偽的假面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我對你說的每一句話，都是真心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次見到你的時候，你還不會走路，只會倚坐在你母親的膝蓋上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王殘黨？你是想說這個詞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很擔心你的出生……就是一場邪惡的儀式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，恰恰相反，你甚至希望這樣，對嗎？你希望自己的生命是一場徹頭徹尾的陰謀，這樣你就可以放心地去厭恨它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是弗朗茨，這沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的母親是一位可敬的夫人。她本就是烏提卡家族的後人，是巫王殘留的血脈……在別人眼中，她不可能不是巫王殘黨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她死前將你託付給了她的同伴，一位巫王的舊臣。他同樣為了救你死在了女皇之聲的手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要恨他們嗎？恨這些真心愛護你的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們在拿走了我的愛之後，還想告訴我，我連恨都不配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們希望，我只是一具空殼，好讓你們把那老頭塞進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……那就試試看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王的低語，衣袍，冠冕……還有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等赫爾昏佐倫的力量降臨，他將結束你悲慘的命運，治癒你身上的傷痕與苦痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說過了，放開他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然還是追上來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要突破外面的一層層術式，很難吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的責任。我不會放棄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然能劈開我的防禦術式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一天，我都會用源石技藝打磨我的劍。我會確保它和我的意志一樣堅硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的劍上有特殊的……針對萊塔尼亞傳統法術的術式。是老師教你這麼做的嗎？他準備好了要與萊塔尼亞為敵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺子從不主動選擇敵人，我也是。敵人會自己從陰影中走出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你，格哈德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從未設想過，我的劍鋒也會朝向曾經的同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有必要針鋒相對，萊辛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅耶爾家族世代都服務於烏提卡家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你願意站過來，輔佐弗朗茨，王座邊定有你的一席之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……王座？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到的，只有一張舊椅子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的爺爺，我的父母……我們在這樣的椅子旁邊困得夠久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我何必自縛手腳，踏上老路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，說得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一個不願意被過去束縛的人，都會想嘗試另一種命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你，就像我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“首席”已經開始演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人，能阻止赫爾昏佐倫的降臨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王座上的人，不是你們口中的赫爾昏佐倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他的名字是黑鍵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把他帶回去，是我的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要我一息尚存，我就會殺到那張破椅子跟前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管你們有多少人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一起上吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g3_ludwigsuniv_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律……法衛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旋律已經響起來了，就算是你，也不可能截斷它的流淌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍……在鳴響？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的，金律法衛。你能約束一個人的心智，卻影響不了一百個人、一千個人。你的旋律只會淹沒在混亂裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像二十三年前，金律法衛也阻止不了發生在巫王塔下的混戰一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我會殺死混亂本身。"},{"type":"narration","text":"長劍並沒有刺向敵人的胸膛，而是插入了地面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"金色的光輝自劍身奔湧而出，撐滿金律法衛的盔甲，再奔向天空，結成一張與夕陽同色的網，將奏鳴塔罩在其中。\n法術所及之處，所有聲音都被吞沒，只剩下莊嚴的旋律在半空迴盪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金色的……帷幕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是十個以上的金律法衛才能使用的法術！你才一個人，怎麼可能？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律樂章的和諧不容破壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，路德維格大學之外的人，不會聽到任何雜音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以我的血肉與靈魂保證——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有巫王殘黨能活著離開這座塔。你們，還有你們的法術，都必須在此湮滅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g7_ludwigsuniv_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旋律又變了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格哈德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，我等您很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺死我們這些萊塔尼亞的術師，對您來說，應該易如反掌吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您還是和以前一樣，不願意親自動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟你說過多少次了？巫妖只是知識殿堂的守門人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們把知識帶給不同種族，令源石技藝得以長足發展，但從不干涉各個國家。這是巫妖王庭與你們先祖的契約，也是巫妖的生存之道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我明白的。主宰著萊塔尼亞的古老高塔裡，住著一群薩卡茲——哪個萊塔尼亞人能接受這個事實呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真羡慕您啊。就連在面對赫爾昏佐倫的時候，您也僅僅提供了塑造那對雙子的術式而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不需要承擔改變歷史的負擔，也沒有沾上……最親密的朋友的鮮血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真是搞不懂，你到底在想什麼？當年你也是勸我動手阻止赫爾昏佐倫的人，今天卻跟那幫不入流的模仿秀演員混在一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我變了。是您讓我改變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您讓我研究樂章，思考萊塔尼亞的歷史，我照做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我越研究，越感到……絕望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫的成就太過耀眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他解決了敘拉古的問題，拯救萊塔尼亞於分崩離析的邊緣。他戰勝了科西嘉一世，令萊塔尼亞不至於淪為高盧的附庸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次又一次足以殺死萊塔尼亞的危機，都因他的存在而化解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這樣一位……偉大的王，卻被我們殺死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰讓你看赫爾昏佐倫偉不偉大了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說他偉不偉大跟他弄死那麼多薩卡茲和萊塔尼亞人害得整個國家烏煙瘴氣還不聽勸有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫你研究金律樂章，是想讓你想開點，是個國家就那麼點屁事，你吃的苦頭很多人都吃過，時間長了誰還不是日子照過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果你犯這種蠢，對得起戰死的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可我見不到他們了，老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不像您，您是連死亡都能操縱的薩卡茲。我們死了就是死了，只能變成地上的一顆塵埃。死去的人永遠感受不到我的悔恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年是我勸說他們，讓他們戰死在巫王塔裡。假如這場戰鬥不曾發生，巫王就不會死，他們也不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢貨。所以你想復活赫爾昏佐倫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該不會以為，等你見到他，他會表揚你或者安撫你吧？他又不是什麼會給笨孩子唱搖籃曲的好爺爺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他壓根看都不會看你一眼。他只會把你看作一粒微塵，抬抬手就把你揮到地磚上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈……哈哈……老師，您還是不明白……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像我這樣，自私又懦弱的人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做的所有的事，不都是為了……求得自己的原諒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手裡的是……丟失的金律樂章？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更確切地說，是留在金律樂章上的，屬於赫爾昏佐倫的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想強行使用赫爾昏佐倫的術式？別犯蠢了，格哈德，你做不到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走得太遠了，老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想……後悔第二次。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅得發黑，宛如浸透了鮮血的火焰升騰而起。\n密室的牆壁劇烈地震動著，源石晶簇從每一塊磚石的縫隙中鑽出來，不斷生長，甚至刺破了地面結構層。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走，格哈德準備毀掉整座學校！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫……王……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塵世之音……在我腦子裡沸騰，它就快……自由了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起作用的不是塵世之音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道是誰搞錯了，又或者是格哈德放棄了從你身上召喚巫王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫的力量不是從你腦子裡鑽出來的，關鍵的旋律不在你身上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來得比我預計的要慢一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是為了救那些憲兵嗎？你變得心軟了呢。那個為了任務不管不顧的執行者去哪裡了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第四座雕塑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你並不在演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執行者先生，你是不是很驚訝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就說過了，你沒有必要急著找到我。在真正的演奏對象出現之前，我也只是一位聽眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樓下那些人正在體會的幻覺並非你的琴聲引起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和我較量了這麼多年，還是會把我的琴聲帶來的“真實”和其他戲法大師造成的“幻覺”混淆，可真令我傷心啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，你難道沒有看見嗎？困在這座塔裡的人，他們本就彼此仇恨，爭鬥不休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將混亂的源頭全部歸結為影響心靈的源石技藝，是否也是一種逃避？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞的事務並不在拉特蘭公證所的契約範圍內。我的首要目標是你，以及與你關聯的人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"操縱這些雕塑來保護你的人是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一位聽眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到得太慢了，否則的話，你們可以一起坐在觀眾席的最前面，欣賞接下來的《巫王之死》。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第五座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，我熟悉你犯下的每一次罪行。你的源石技藝影響的對象遍布不同的地區與階層，但你過去從未主動參與過政治層面的紛爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得我母親的葬禮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓所有人釋放了藏在心中的情感。那是我第一次發現，人們會那麼輕易地在我的旋律中沉淪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我並不欣喜。與之相反，我感到失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強烈的情感帶來的不該只有混亂。情感本應使人們的心靈變得強大，強大到能突破一切困境與阻礙……甚至注定的消亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我來這裡尋找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第六座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你要尋找的演奏對象是巫王的話，你不可能成功。巫王早已死去，你的旋律無法影響死者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你對這場演出有所誤解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王座上的影子已然消散，孿生的英雄走出高塔迎接眾人的仰望……而留在原地的人們，仍深陷在目睹山巒崩塌時的種種情緒裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《巫王之死》……這首曲子的主角，從來都不是巫王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g5_spiralstairs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼……我們為什麼在這裡？呃啊，我的手好痛！我怎麼在流血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樓梯在晃！難道塔要塌了？這黑色的火焰是什麼，怎麼從地裡一直鑽出來……救命啊，救命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是赫爾昏佐倫的術式。大家倒是清醒了些……我們得立刻撤出這座塔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵C","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵C","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燭火……燭……燭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燭火？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這黑焰……整座奏鳴塔都被黑焰包裹了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會為你們開道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用您的燭火嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意火光映在牆上的暗影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暗影在……撕扯黑焰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。這才是我的源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是，其實並沒有那麼美麗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，女士……很震撼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很少見到一種源石技藝，能與赫爾昏佐倫的不滅黑焰相匹敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不能戰勝它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是真實存在的事物，就一定會留下影子……我能短暫地利用這一點，撐開一點點求生的可能性，就已是極限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，我剛站在您的對面，您不怪我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什麼好責怪您的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您聲稱自己並不是女皇之聲，很巧，我也並未正式進入女皇的高塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡的，可以只是您，還有薇薇安娜。我們並不是在執行女皇的命令，而是想幫助這些在琴聲中掙扎的可憐人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，趁學生們恢復了行動能力，請帶著他們衝出去吧。我還能再堅持一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到塔外的金色光輝了，金律法衛的“帷幕”已經把這裡圍了起來。他隨時可能毀掉整座塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，布蘭特閣下會做出最恰當的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燭火終會熄滅。能挑選一個有意義些的時刻，就已經很好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"霍赫貝格女士……薇薇安娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，米夏埃爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請保護好你自己，還有這群年輕人。你們有著……像我這樣的人無法奢望的未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g3_ludwigsuniv_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圍住這座塔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇塔的術師？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，布蘭特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是說過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是女皇的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法衛閣下，我們會協助您，解決這裡的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。用你們的源石技藝，與我合奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會讓帷幕收緊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，布蘭特閣下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開，赫琳瑪特的密使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你還要妨礙我們？就你之前的表現，已經具有與巫王殘黨勾結的嫌疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奏鳴塔裡還有無辜的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到學生們都撤了出來。弗萊蒙特閣下還不至於死在我們的源石技藝之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔先生，還有薇薇安娜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜還在塔裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她被黑焰困住了。為了救我和其他學生，她留在了最後面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是消滅威脅的最佳機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等合奏完成，你的力量會使得整座塔一起湮滅，薇薇安娜也會死去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……深入戰場，是她自己的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃爾納已經為萊塔尼亞犧牲了一生，不能讓他唯一的女兒也步其後塵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你答應沃爾納會救她的，我們都答應了。你忘記你的誓言了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g5_spiralstairs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“金律法衛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賴納，你是否已忘記自己的誓言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“金律法衛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律法衛的劍與法術，都只屬於金律樂章與萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“金律法衛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論赫爾昏佐倫如何對待他的子民，他都是金律樂章認可的萊塔尼亞的君主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“金律法衛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如你選擇與霍赫貝格家族並肩作戰，那你就放棄了身為金律法衛的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“金律法衛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再往前一步，你將成為所有金律法衛的敵人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g4_towerroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特……為什麼沒來救我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起長大，與你親如兄弟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明也痛恨著巫王，痛恨他對施彤領的子民施下的暴政，痛恨他把我們的家園徵作戰場與實驗場所！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四皇會戰過去那麼多年了，至今施彤領的上空依舊滿是源石碎屑組成的天災雲，我們的許多孩子不得不帶著那些被詛咒的石頭降生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不能反抗？為什麼不能讓他付出代價？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只因為金律樂章規定了他是君主，而我們是僕從？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！布蘭特，我們不該生來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的力量是某個不可違逆的意志的附庸，那你的意志，金律法衛的意志，是否根本只是個謊言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這個謊言，讓你逃避選擇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“霍赫貝格”","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃避你對霍赫貝格家族的死者的愧疚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g3_ludwigsuniv_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的身軀幾不可見地搖晃了一下。\n金色的帷幕，出現了一塊小小的裂痕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……共鳴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總算……捕捉到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第七座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有雕塑均已擊碎。阿爾圖羅，你已無力抵抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請再稍等片刻，我親愛的費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特·賴納，他的心靈終於對我的旋律敞開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頑強的意志終於突破了束縛，湧現的情感將引領他做出最無悔的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我一直在等待的……屬於這首曲子的，真正的高潮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_i05"},{"type":"narration","text":"激昂到近乎尖利的旋律在阿爾圖羅的琴弦下響起。\n彷彿受到琴聲的激勵，黑色的源石之焰自地底深處躍起，撕裂了咫尺外的地面。\n守在塔下的巫王樂手們列著隊走入黑焰，在化作灰燼之前，不斷地吟唱著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"支撐天空的高塔，無可取代，不可或缺的永恆之柱——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"崛起吧！"},{"type":"narration","text":"有什麼東西從大地的血肉中鑽了出來。\n那是一座高塔。\n黑中透赤，螺旋形狀，尖銳怪異。\n宛如遺落已久的巫王塔重現於大地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
